tors Alumni Faculty & Staff Human Resources CAREERS Office of Human Resources At Coker University, our staff are more than employees. They are team of professionals on a mission to launch the next generation of world changers. High performance leadership is about excellence and integrity at all levels. And a career at Coker is founded on the desire to lead with compassion, enthusiasm, and a heart for service. If you’re seeking a purpose-driven academic culture, our Cobra family is a perfect fit. Home / Offices & Services / Human Resources Related Links Faculty Jobs Faculty, Staff, Coach, and Administration Jobs View Open Staff & Administration Positions Why Choose Coker for Your Next Career Move A student-focused, private university with a liberal arts core, Coker University is located in Hartsville, South Carolina. Founded in 1908, Coker is a bachelor’s and master’s degree-granting institution and competes in 24 NCAA Division II sports. Ours is a community that will value your influence, support your expertise, and expand your leadership, career, and life potential. Make Your Next Move GO HIGHER WITH A CAREER AT COKER upcoming events WHAT’S HAPPENING AT COKER View Calendar Coker News Read more Aug 27, 2026 Coker University Receives NSF Grant to Enhance Research Capacity and Build Sustainable STEM Workforce Pathways in South Carolina $615,000 award funds undergraduate scholars, faculty mentors, and research infrastructure over four years \nAug…. Aug 21, 2026 Coker University Announces District Days, Offers to Fund Transportation for Local High Schools Coker University is making it a little easier for local students to experience campus in person this year…. Jun 05, 2026 Coker University Announces New Kids in Parks TRACK Trail at Kalmia Gardens June 5, 2026 — Coker University is proud to announce that Kalmia Gardens has officially joined the national K… Be part of our community, as we work together to learn, lead, and inspire. Request Information arrow_forward Plan Y